<title>USA: Invacare extends offer for Healthdyne.</title>
<headline>Invacare extends offer for Healthdyne.</headline>
<dateline>ELYRIA, Ohio 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Invacare Corp said its IHH Corp subsidiary had extended until April 7 its $13-per-share tender offer for Healthdyne Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>As of Monday, about 2.3 million shares of Healthdyne had been tendered under the offer, which had been scheduled to expire Monday, Invacare said in a statement released yesterday.</p>
<p>Invacare said it now has about 23 percent of Healthdyne's outstanding common stock, including 600,000 shares previously owned.</p>
